IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. Q11-COMPOUND-INT.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-PRINCIPAL       PIC 9(9)V99 VALUE 0.
01 WS-RATE            PIC 9(3)V99 VALUE 0.
01 WS-YEARS           PIC 9(3) VALUE 0.
01 WS-IDX             PIC 9(3) VALUE 0.
01 WS-AMOUNT          PIC 9(12)V9(6) VALUE 0.
01 WS-FINAL-AMT       PIC 9(12)V99 VALUE 0.
01 WS-DISP-AMT        PIC Z(11)9.99.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
ACCEPT WS-PRINCIPAL
ACCEPT WS-RATE
ACCEPT WS-YEARS
MOVE WS-PRINCIPAL TO WS-AMOUNT
PERFORM VARYING WS-IDX FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-IDX > WS-YEARS
    COMPUTE WS-AMOUNT = WS-AMOUNT + (WS-AMOUNT * WS-RATE / 100)
END-PERFORM
COMPUTE WS-FINAL-AMT ROUNDED = WS-AMOUNT
MOVE WS-FINAL-AMT TO WS-DISP-AMT
DISPLAY FUNCTION TRIM(WS-DISP-AMT)
STOP RUN.
